      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/houhanshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:houhanshu-142a1dda5fda6f61",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 3572,
      "excerpt": "道被誅。立三十四年，國除。\n\n〔注[一]今貝州宗城縣也，隨室諱改焉。〕\n\n下邳惠王衍\n\n下邳惠王衍，永平十五年封。衍有容貌，肅宗即位，常在左右。建初初冠，詔賜衍師傅已下官屬金帛各有差。四年，以臨淮郡及九江之鐘離﹑當塗﹑東城﹑歷陽﹑全椒合十七縣益",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "後漢書/卷50",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%BE%8C%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B750",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2457184",
      "textSha256": "03688da3f68854b786d1b5798c42bdfe0fff7140ed70caeca73dbeeb4bf52d7f",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/houhanshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-3da789286e895a6e",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 11614,
      "excerpt": "也。性纯笃闲雅，好礼无违，存心经诰，博学洽闻。选为濮阳王文学，迁领军长史，丧官。王衍时为领军，哭之甚恸。〕\n\n鄭渾\n\n郑浑字文公，河南开封人也。高祖父众，众父兴，皆为名儒。〔续汉书曰：兴字少赣，谏议大夫。众字子师，大司农。〕浑兄泰，与荀攸等谋诛",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷16",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B716",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2610840",
      "textSha256": "32e2ed205bcfde82111415e0ec80db1efa6ffbb5eacb2ec1850e8e2d08c601d0",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-034e27b90c698a59",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 9072,
      "excerpt": "泰舒。有器度幹用，歷職著績，終於太僕。次弟豫，字泰寧，相國參軍，知名，早卒。女適王衍。配弟鎮，字季南，謁者僕射。鎮子弈，字泰業。山濤啟事稱弈高簡有雅量，歷位雍州刺史、尚書。〕\n\n【評】\n\n評曰：滿寵立志剛毅，勇而有謀。田豫居身清白，規畧明練。牽",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷26",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B726",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2085108",
      "textSha256": "2508c924d1aee65cbb795b1ecb2748f23ed0a86ab7260cb15cec77b9420b2077",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:songshu-153e51e70c5cc1b0",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 5993,
      "excerpt": "明帝造\n\n皇業沿德建，帝運資勳融。\n\n胤唐重盛軌，胄楚載休風。\n\n堯帝兆深祥，元王衍遐慶。\n\n積善傳上業，祚福啟英聖。\n\n衰數隨金祿，登歷昌永命。\n\n維宋垂光烈，世美流舞咏。\n\n《聖祖頌》\n\n聖祖惟高德，積勳代晉歷。\n\n永建享鴻基，萬古盛音冊。",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "宋書/卷22",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B722",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=449316",
      "textSha256": "ef3d1a80dfc9bef5200c0e440b67b8277174c980b5fbedb10b9a19ae39bd7652",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/songshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-178e0178b4c349d8",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 8052,
      "excerpt": "皇太弟，以隆我晉邦。以司空越爲太傅，與太宰顒夾輔朕躬。司徒王戎參錄朝政，光祿大夫王衍爲尚書左僕射。安南將軍虓、安北將軍浚〔安北將軍浚「浚」原作「濬」。周校：安北將軍時爲王浚。今據懷紀、成都王穎傳及本傳改。〕、平北將軍騰各守本鎮。高密王簡爲鎮南將",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷004",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7004",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2317129",
      "textSha256": "ba2a78ad886733210936e2eb1156d73160350340b2255229e47ec7b4dc1d43f4",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-1d9179447366c9ff",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 5,
      "offset": 502,
      "excerpt": "植子融爲樂城縣王。南陽王模殺河間王顒于雍谷。辛丑，以中書監溫羨爲司徒，尚書左僕射王衍爲司空。己酉，葬孝惠皇帝于太陽陵。李雄別帥李離寇梁州。\n\n永嘉元年\n\n　　永嘉元年春正月癸丑朔〔正月癸丑朔　正月壬子朔，非癸丑。〕，大赦，改元，除三族刑。以太傅",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷005",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7005",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=7904721",
      "textSha256": "dbe8bf574eec0bc2eac67bd18de0c04ce36df78bec98d118f8f07496f5e8423a",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-7801302bec230636",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 8986,
      "excerpt": "后知瑋怨之，乃使帝作密詔令瑋誅瓘、亮，以報宿憾。模知后凶暴，恐禍及己，乃與裴頠、王衍謀廢之，衍悔而謀寢。\n\n　　后遂荒淫放恣，與太醫令程據等亂彰內外。洛南有盜尉部小吏，端麗美容止，既給冢役，忽有非常衣服，眾咸疑其竊盜，尉嫌而辯之。賈后疏親欲求盜",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷031",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7031",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2479706",
      "textSha256": "8bd172744c2d5c4b4e21b3805e86739fae9d62e49588d6ed145813dd29974048",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-35dc9ee348937c6c",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 2300,
      "excerpt": "是彰其德，於祜無傷也。」\n\n　　祜貞愨無私，疾惡邪佞，荀勖、馮紞之徒甚忌之。從甥王衍嘗詣祜陳事，辭甚俊辨，祜不然之，衍拂衣而起。祜顧謂賓客曰：「王夷甫方以盛名處大位，然敗俗傷化，必此人也。」步闡之役，祜以軍法將斬王戎，故戎、衍並憾之，每言論多毀",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷034",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7034",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2567662",
      "textSha256": "64b4f2d2bb00d44c09bb880d495075789b538d79d7af9846b375b4471f3048e1",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-8abf91def4061bc7",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 4,
      "offset": 4549,
      "excerpt": "蕩，不尊儒術，何晏、阮籍素有高名於世，口談浮虛，不遵禮法，屍祿耽寵，仕不事事；至王衍之徒，聲譽太盛，位高勢重，不以物務自嬰，遂相放效，風教陵遲，乃著崇有之論以釋其蔽曰：\n\n夫總混群本，宗極之道也。方以族異，庶類之品也。形象著分，有生之體也。化感",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷035",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7035",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2506399",
      "textSha256": "07d0c0d87d07bc1a3af6aadf9dadd4b2ee9cecac5e553c43c9e40fc50c145e84",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-9466e1adbb9fcd49",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 8541,
      "excerpt": "公。太寧二年卒，追贈衛尉，諡曰定。子達嗣。\n\n藩弟組\n\n　　組字大章。弱冠，太尉王衍見而稱之曰：「夷雅有才識。」初為司徒左西屬，補太子舍人。司徒王渾請為從事中郎，轉左長史，歷太子中庶子、滎陽太守。\n\n　　趙王倫為相國，欲收大名，選海內德望之士，",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷039",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7039",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2108782",
      "textSha256": "e78bb13a204125de708ea97c5b05f393ba3d0d26b48f2aa531eecdbaadc2da56",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-f1afb7134dc4d68b",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 4840,
      "excerpt": "帝立，更使議之。謐上議，請從泰始爲斷。於是事下三府，司徒王戎、司空張華、領軍將軍王衍、侍中樂廣、黃門侍郎嵇紹、國子博士謝衡皆從謐議。騎都尉濟北侯荀畯、侍中荀籓、黃門侍郎華混以爲宜用正始開元。博士荀熙、刁協謂宜嘉平起年。謐重執奏戎、華之議，事遂施",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷040",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7040",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2606035",
      "textSha256": "4eada1960db5354eddb9eb7a349167b2bd4b8a89ce09a79bdba350be1142dccb",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-7cefb98600233392",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 3,
      "offset": 6393,
      "excerpt": "十二，諡曰元。\n\n　　戎有人倫鑒識，嘗目山濤如璞玉渾金，人皆欽其寶，莫知名其器；王衍神姿高徹，如瑤林瓊樹，自然是風塵表物。謂裴頠拙於用長，荀勖工於用短，陳道寧𦃩𦃩如束長竿。族弟敦有高名，戎惡之。敦每候戎，輒托疾不見。敦後果為逆亂。其鑒嘗先見",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷043",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7043",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2618531",
      "textSha256": "51491f8d2a5f7f06ee5796fbbfcd82f70acae620d8e73c012c06c86ceb952c0d",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-204f45c1f153bc69",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 4,
      "offset": 2387,
      "excerpt": "然，其旨同異？」瞻曰：「將無同。」戎咨嗟良久，即命辟之。時人謂之「三語掾」。太尉王衍亦雅重之。瞻嘗群行，冒熱渇甚，逆旅有井，衆人競趨之，瞻獨逡巡在後，須飲者畢乃進，其夷退無競如此。\n\n　　東海王越鎭許昌，以瞻爲記室參軍，與王承、謝鯤、鄧攸倶在越",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷049",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7049",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2199702",
      "textSha256": "9f20d6dbbafdc71aa4d13438172785033089359fce1820a9a44ab0e6d55534cd",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-41d913bcc042af99",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 3,
      "offset": 3159,
      "excerpt": "酣暢，寄通而已。處眾人中，居然獨立。嘗讀《老》《莊》，曰：「正與人意暗同。」太尉王衍雅重之。\n\n　　敳見王室多難，終知嬰禍，乃著《意賦》以豁情，猶賈誼之《服鳥》也。其詞曰：「至理歸於渾一兮，榮辱固亦同貫。存亡既已均齊兮，正盡死復何歎。物咸定于無",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷050",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7050",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2305862",
      "textSha256": "959d5967b2960cbb0a33ea21171d07b0ff5204bb17f4d847f6dc21b9f7147a78",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-573c559717aeddd4",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 998,
      "excerpt": "母郭槐欲以韓壽女為太子妃，太子亦欲婚韓氏以自固。而壽妻賈午及后皆不聽，而為太子聘王衍小女惠風。太子聞衍長女美，而賈后為謐聘之，心不能平，頗以為言。謐嘗與太子圍棋，爭道，成都王穎見而訶謐，謐意愈不平，因此譖太子于后曰：「太子廣買田業，多畜私財以結",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷053",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7053",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2595666",
      "textSha256": "4e47099188ff09cf7dd85136782a23078d5523d9f50534038af60334afa6e100",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-8fc04ce126a6681b",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 13166,
      "excerpt": "以乂為大都督以距顒。連戰自八月至十月，朝議以乂、穎兄弟，可以辭說而釋，乃使中書令王衍行太尉，光祿勳石陋行司徒，使說穎，令與乂分陝而居，穎不從。乂因致書於穎曰：\n\n先帝應乾撫運，統攝四海，勤身苦己，克成帝業，六合清泰，慶流子孫。孫秀作逆，反易天常",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷059",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7059",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2650517",
      "textSha256": "0790f402debc7e4a152ed0a11fcc604599345d8badf0a43e93c804b89ff7778d",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-343828d782a307a7",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 9132,
      "excerpt": "尚書郎，朝士多稱之。東海王越聞，召以爲主簿。王彌逼洛，敦及胡毋輔之勸越擊王彌，而王衍、潘滔共執不聽，敦庭爭苦至，眾咸壯之。出補汝南內史。元帝之爲鎮東，請爲軍諮祭酒，不就。征南將軍山簡以爲司馬。尋而王如、杜曾相繼爲亂，簡乃使敦監沔北七郡軍事、振威",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷070",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7070",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2595540",
      "textSha256": "c12d913de07777a34ad13df2f6b4a198b9a370f8a568880a6dee31856f87dc2d",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-9ed4cd34361b22e9",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 794,
      "excerpt": "欲，無所修尚。言理辯物，但明其指要而不飾文辭，有識者服其約而能通。弱冠知名。太尉王衍雅貴異之，比南陽樂廣焉。永寧初，為驃騎參軍。值天下將亂，乃避難南下。遷司空從事中郎。豫迎大駕，賜爵藍田縣侯。遷尚書郎，不就。東海王越鎮許，以為記室參軍。雅相知重",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷075",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7075",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2645530",
      "textSha256": "8c893e6ae7786603fab8d7cfcb73ce0f072307d0714e725de1962f03f6d7df11",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:jinshu-c7b11efb985b45d5",
      "query": "王衍",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 5593,
      "excerpt": "東曹掾。克素有格量，及居選官，苟進之徒，望風畏憚。初，克未仕時，河內山簡嘗與琅邪王衍書曰：「蔡子尼今之正人。」衍以書示眾曰：「山子以一字拔人，然未易可稱。」後衍聞克在選官，曰：「山子正人之言，驗於今矣。」陳留時為大郡，號稱多士，琅邪王澄行經其界",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "晉書/卷077",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7077",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=8750392",
      "textSha256": "8805e2a6805a5d0ea91452ac1c50700f6ca0ba9da7f2ab43f08cbaabc1d19a17",
